*-------------*                                                                 
* REPORT      *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
*                                                                               
  REPORT RAPPORT01 PRINTER W12210D2 LINESIZE 120 +                              
                   NOADJUST NODATE +                                            
                   SPACE 0  TITLESKIP 2                                         
    SEQUENCE W-KDPRODSL IDANSK W-IDARTNR                                        
